{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"艾道拿今晚終勝出「頌星」破悶局。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/4c3fd064bdc36d7912c59719133dfd90/2026-11/m1_8.jpg\"/><p>艾道拿自上月廿八日贏「致力之城」後，近一個月未贏馬，今晚終勝出賀廄「頌星」破悶局；此馬上兩仗配艾道拿均獲亞，今戰終坐正。馬主旋風團體經理人蒙德揚說：「賀賢表示因五班千四米賽程少，故部署『頌星』跑谷草一哩，結果順利取勝。」</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.825607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:50:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:28.150731+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:28.150731+00:00","content_hash":"4f02b596ad2f6d990d1d673047849ffb802bb9257defb48dcb6f7a7fa3041537","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}